  "translation": "Na Yahwe i smelim ⟨את⟩ swit smel bilong malolo, na Yahwe i tok long bel bilong en: Bai mi no ken kirapim olgeta na krosim ⟨את⟩ graun moa bilong ol man, long wanem ol laik bilong bel bilong man i nogut bilong taim em i yangpela yet; na bai mi no ken paitim olgeta na kilim ⟨את⟩ olgeta samting i gat laif moa, olsem we mi wokim pinis.",
